<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Linux - Category - Feiyang Wu Personal Page</title><link>https://Raventhatfly.github.io/categories/linux/</link><description>Linux - Category | Feiyang Wu Personal Page</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>raventhatfly@gmail.com (Feiyang Wu)</managingEditor><webMaster>raventhatfly@gmail.com (Feiyang Wu)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Sep 2024 18:22:34 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Raventhatfly.github.io/categories/linux/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Xshell使用</title><link>https://Raventhatfly.github.io/posts/85a045e/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Sep 2024 18:22:34 +0800</pubDate><author>Feiyang Wu</author><guid>https://Raventhatfly.github.io/posts/85a045e/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>由于希望使用Linux服务器上的可视化工具，使用X11对Linux服务器的GUI进行转发。</p>
<p>参考博客：<a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/tsfh/p/9022170.html"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://www.cnblogs.com/tsfh/p/9022170.html</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/xuyaowen/p/ssh-X11forward.html"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://www.cnblogs.com/xuyaowen/p/ssh-X11forward.html</a></p>
<h3 id="step-1" class="heading-element"><span>Step 1.</span>
  <a href="#step-1" class="heading-mark">
    <svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg>
  </a>
</h3><p>服务器： sudo vim /etc/ssh/sshd_config 修改以下配置，如果在配置文件里面没有找到，就直接添加到文件末尾即可，最后保存退出:wq</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span><span class="lnt">5
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">X11Forwarding yes
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">X11DisplayOffset <span class="m">10</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">X11UseLocalhost yes</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>服务器端修改完成后需要执行命令重启sshd服务</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo systemctl restart sshd.service</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="step-2" class="heading-element"><span>Step 2.</span>
  <a href="#step-2" class="heading-mark">
    <svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg>
  </a>
</h3><p>Windows上安装Putty和Xming。启动 XLaunch之后，记住display number，默认值为0。
之后打开putty，点击Connection-&gt;SHH-&gt;AUTH-&gt;X11，勾选enbale X11，<code>x display location</code>
填写<code>localhost:&lt;Display Number&gt;</code>，例如<code>localhost:0</code>。</p>
<h3 id="step-3" class="heading-element"><span>Step 3.</span>
